desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Contains Bidirectional Characters"
	title_zh: "检测到双向控制字符",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-contains-bidirectional-characters"
	risk: "unicode-direction-control"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
This code contains bidirectional (bidi) characters. While this is useful for support of right-to-left languages such as Arabic or Hebrew, it can also be used to trick language parsers into executing code in a manner that is different from how it is displayed in code editing and review tools.

### 风险类型
Unicode 双向控制字符（unicode-direction-control）

### 影响
源码中隐藏双向控制字符，可能使显示内容与真实执行逻辑不一致，形成混淆攻击。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除隐藏 Unicode 控制字符，并使用可显示隐藏字符的编辑器审查源码。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
allow = "admin‮evil"
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
allow = "admin-evil"
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/[\x{202A}-\x{202E}\x{2066}-\x{2069}]/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Contains Bidirectional Characters",
	title_zh: "检测到双向控制字符",
	message: "Bidirectional Unicode control character detected; source display may differ from parser behavior.",
}
